01:12:18,639 --> 01:12:21,320
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So some people, they cannot relate

1199
01:12:21,320 --> 01:12:23,040
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: to one big loan.

1200
01:12:23,040 --> 01:12:30,500
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Mas, um, mas naging madali para sa kanila or mas naging, um, specific.

1201
01:12:31,679 --> 01:12:35,199
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: It's easier for us to loan out the money kung specific because then they can relate.

1202
01:12:35,199 --> 01:12:36,239
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Ay, para sa akin to.

