1211
01:13:08,520 --> 01:13:10,760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But now it's 7 to 10 days.

1212
01:13:11,280 --> 01:13:15,960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But now we've got a backlog because madami na pong umuutang.

1213
01:13:15,960 --> 01:13:19,239
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And now we need more funds to accommodate

1214
01:13:19,600 --> 01:13:20,880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: more, um,

1215
01:13:20,880 --> 01:13:22,520
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: more MSMEs that can loan,

1216
01:13:22,520 --> 01:13:24,840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Especially because of the Middle East crisis.

1217
01:13:24,840 --> 01:13:26,679
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: That's why nandito po kami to—

