01:14:20,880 --> 01:14:21,660
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: MSME Fund.

1236
01:14:21,800 --> 01:14:23,560
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We also have the e-transport.

1237
