03:04:58,080 --> 03:04:59,399
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: na halal investment

3536
03:04:59,399 --> 03:05:01,720
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at palaguin ang halal business

3537
03:05:01,720 --> 03:05:03,860
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: sa pamamagitan ng

3538
03:05:04,080 --> 03:05:04,840
