DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: I will defer to Bianca

3551
03:05:35,239 --> 03:05:39,080
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: regarding this, um, halal.

3552
03:05:39,080 --> 03:05:43,479
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Good afternoon, ma’am. For the halal industry,

3553
03:05:43,479 --> 03:05:44,819
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): we were able to certify

3554
03:05:45,160 --> 03:05:47,520
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): 277 MSMEs

3555
03:05:48,399 --> 03:05:50,479
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): that caters to both the domestic

3556
03:05:50,479 --> 03:05:51,739
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): and export market

3557
03:05:52,880 --> 03:05:55,840
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): For 2026 we were able to assist

3558
03:05:55,840 --> 03:05:57,520
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): 140 MSMEs

3559
03:05:57,520 --> 03:06:02,120
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): to be halal-certified, again, both for the domestic and export market.

3560
03:06:02,720 --> 03:06:11,080
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Under the direction of the Secretary, we are also featuring halal products in all our national trade shows.

3561
03:06:12,120 --> 03:06:16,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ibig sabihin po, mas tumaas po tayo ngayong taon. Tama po ba?

3562
03:06:16,600 --> 03:06:19,640
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Yes po, in terms of halal-certified MSMEs po.

3563
03:06:19,640 --> 03:06:29,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay. Kaugnay po ng aking naunang katanungan, the DTI has also reported intensifying its halal accreditation program

3564
03:06:29,760 --> 03:06:37,399
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: to help MSMEs access the expanding ASEAN market and strengthen export competitiveness.

3565
03:06:38,000 --> 03:06:43,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kung ganun po, magkano ba ang nakalaang budget ng DTI para sa programang ito

3566
03:06:43,600 --> 03:06:49,559
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: at ilang MSMEs ang maaaring ma-cater ng allocated budget?

3567
03:06:53,560 --> 03:06:57,280
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): We have roughly 90 million pesos for halal po.

3568
03:06:59,200 --> 03:07:00,439
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: ₱90 million?

3569
03:07:00,439 --> 03:07:05,380
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Yes po. Last year, for halal certification and promotion of halal products.

3570
03:07:05,399 --> 03:07:06,620
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ilan yung target nito?

3571
03:07:08,200 --> 03:07:11,559
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): For next year po, it's 81 million pesos.

3572
03:07:12,399 --> 03:07:19,200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ilang MSMEs ang maaaring makater ng next year's budget na 81 billion?

3573
03:07:20,720 --> 03:07:22,399
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): We'll do our best to match the

3574
03:07:22,399 --> 03:07:30,079
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): the level of assistance that we've provided this year and in 2025 despite the lower budget in 2027.

3575
03:07:30,359 --> 03:07:33,640
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Oo nga po no, medyo nababaan. Medyo na-alarma ako.

3576
03:07:33,640 --> 03:07:42,160
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana matapatan pa natin, lalong-lalo na na may ibang bansa na mas marami pa rin ang Muslim sa ating bansa

3577
03:07:42,160 --> 03:07:47,619
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: pero sa ibang bansa na kagaya ng Thailand ay mas nagbo-boom na rin po ang halal industry nila.

3578
03:07:48,399 --> 03:07:52,380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa tingin nyo, sapat na ba itong para mapagbigyan?

3579
03:07:52,560 --> 03:07:59,200
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang ating export competitiveness at ma-penetrate ang halal markets natin sa ASEAN at Middle East?

3580
03:08:01,200 --> 03:08:09,620
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Actually, Honorable Congresswoman, we need more budget talaga for the halal considering na ang laking potential ng halal globally.

3581
03:08:10,200 --> 03:08:20,680
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, actually nasa 3 trillion US dollars na po ang potential ng halal but we need to get our products certified

3582
03:08:20,680 --> 03:08:21,959
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and we need more...

3583
03:08:22,920 --> 03:08:29,240
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: for the products to join more trade shows para mas makikilala yung mga produkto natin globally.

3584
03:08:29,600 --> 03:08:35,359
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But locally, we also see a growing population of Muslims in the Philippines.

3585
03:08:35,359 --> 03:08:37,180
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In fact, we're already 13 million.

3586
03:08:37,560 --> 03:08:39,999
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We have more Muslims now than in UAE.

3587
03:08:40,399 --> 03:08:43,840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So, malaki din po yung potential ng halal products dito.

3588
03:08:43,840 --> 03:08:50,479
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But we need more budget actually for the certification and also for the slaughterhouse.

3589
03:08:50,479 --> 03:08:52,420
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi yun po yung importante.

3590
03:08:52,640 --> 03:08:59,580
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then to be able to produce the quality products or halal products that can compete globally.

3591
03:08:59,760 --> 03:09:03,820
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: In the past, wala masyadong budget in the past 2 years.

3592
03:09:04,359 --> 03:09:10,439
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But for this year, nakikita natin that this is really a huge potential for export po.

3593
03:09:11,439 --> 03:09:13,500
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Definitely, Madam Chair.

3594
03:09:13,520 --> 03:09:14,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I agree to this.

3595
03:09:14,600 --> 03:09:20,920
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Na kinakailangan natin na palaguin pa ito dahil may potential nga naman itong halal industry na ito.

3596
03:09:20,920 --> 03:09:22,439
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At with that, I would like to...

3597
03:09:22,439 --> 03:09:28,120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: manifest, Madam Chair, my strong support para sa pagdagdag ng budget po ng DTI,

3598
03:09:28,120 --> 03:09:32,080
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Particularly on the halal industry budget po nila.

3599
03:09:32,080 --> 03:09:35,359
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: I have another question, Madam Chair.

3600
03:09:35,359 --> 03:09:42,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Dadako po ako sa concerns ng ating mga stakeholders sa mga Muslim Filipino community.

3601
03:09:42,880 --> 03:09:51,000
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa aming konsultasyon sa kanila, marami pa rin nagsasabi na nahihirapan silang makakuha ng halal accreditation

3602
03:09:51,359 --> 03:09:52,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: o makakuha.

3603
03:09:52,600 --> 03:09:57,460
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Nang suporta mula sa gobyerno para sa halal industry development.

3604
03:09:57,960 --> 03:10:04,380
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ano-ano po ba ang specific na assistance or support mechanism na maaaring ibigay ng DTI

3605
03:10:04,800 --> 03:10:11,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para sa mga halal producers at MSMEs, lalo na sa mga nahihirapang makakuha ng accreditation?

3606
03:10:13,720 --> 03:10:16,720
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Honorable Congresswoman, I'll defer to Bianca on this.

3607
03:10:19,120 --> 03:10:24,279
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Madam, we've actually launched several projects.

3608
03:10:24,279 --> 03:10:27,860
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Aimed at supporting the certification of MSMEs.

3609
03:10:28,120 --> 03:10:33,439
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Tulad po nang nabanggit ko kanina, for 2025, 277 na po ang natulungan natin.

3610
03:10:33,439 --> 03:10:39,739
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): For 2026, we were able to help 140 MSMEs to get their products halal certified.

3611
03:10:40,160 --> 03:10:48,020
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Meron pa po tayong mga ongoing projects, specifically catering to export markets to get them halal certified.

3612
03:10:48,399 --> 03:10:51,940
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): We work directly po with recognized certifying bodies of these—

3613
03:10:54,160 --> 03:10:58,239
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): certifying bodies of our key export markets.

3614
03:10:58,239 --> 03:11:03,439
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: So ibig sabihin yung 140 for this year is ongoing pa, madadagdagan pa po ito.

3615
03:11:03,439 --> 03:11:09,299
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sana po matapatan natin yung 2025 na kahit maging 278, no?

3616
03:11:10,160 --> 03:11:14,279
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Anyway po, another question po, baka ito na po yung huling tanong ko.

3617
03:11:14,279 --> 03:11:24,839
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Sa pag-allocate po ba ng budget para rito sa halal program, na-identify na po ba ng DTI ang mga region o lugar na higit na nangangailangan?

3618
03:11:25,319 --> 03:11:34,120
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ito po ay para masiguro na accessible ito sa lahat ng di lamang naka-centralized sa Metro Manila.

3619
03:11:34,120 --> 03:11:41,880
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Ma'am, for the 277 MSMEs that we've supported, it was actually, it covers eight regions po.

3620
03:11:41,880 --> 03:11:45,660
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): It's not focused on NCR or Metro Manila alone.

3621
03:11:48,120 --> 03:11:53,040
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Madam Chair, isa lamang palusot na katanungan.

3622
03:11:53,040 --> 03:11:55,660
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Alam ko, sinabi ko, huli na lang yung kanina.

3623
03:11:55,920 --> 03:11:59,220
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Minute pa ako, so ilulusot ko po ito.

3624
03:11:59,840 --> 03:12:10,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Ang sabi po sa amin, may nakaabot po sa aking opisina: nagagawa ba raw ng DTI na i-maximize ang koordinasyon sa NCMF

3625
03:12:10,520 --> 03:12:14,479
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: para maging efektibo ang implementasyon ng halal program?

3626
03:12:14,479 --> 03:12:23,760
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At ano ang mga mekanismo na nakalatag para masiguro ang maayos na koordinasyon?

3627
03:12:23,760 --> 03:12:25,319
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Yes, Honorable Congresswoman.

3628
03:12:25,319 --> 03:12:28,080
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We will continue to coordinate through the halal board.

3629
03:12:28,080 --> 03:12:35,120
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: At malaki rin ang potential ng halal, especially once we get all the free trade agreements concluded and signed.

3630
03:12:35,120 --> 03:12:43,840
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi malaking market din po yung remaining five free trade agreements na nakapending pa sa atin.

3631
03:12:43,840 --> 03:12:45,680
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Pero we hope to conclude it this year.

3632
03:12:45,680 --> 03:12:47,640
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So next year, mas malaki po yung market.

3633
03:12:47,640 --> 03:12:53,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: That's why definitely we would request for more budget for the halal industry talaga.

3634
03:12:53,520 --> 03:12:55,099
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Kasi malaki iyong potential.

3635
03:12:55,439 --> 03:12:57,739
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Globally and also locally po.

3636
03:13:00,239 --> 03:13:09,340
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: And I understand, Madam Chair, Madam Secretary, that the head of this board para sa halal industry natin ay ang DTI, tama?

3637
03:13:10,439 --> 03:13:18,520
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: However, I just want to manifest also na kinakailangan din po natin na continuous coordination natin sa NCMF,

3638
03:13:18,520 --> 03:13:22,559
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: lalong-lalo pa po may tinatawag tayong halal standards, no?

3639
03:13:23,680 --> 03:13:28,259
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Huling katanungan, Madam Chair, follow-up lang doon.

3640
03:13:28,760 --> 03:13:38,840
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: May mga insidente po ba tayo na nahuhuli na hindi po nagpa-follow ng strict halal standards po natin?

3641
03:13:38,840 --> 03:13:42,980
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: At kung meron man po, ano pong penalty ang binibigay po natin dito?

3642
03:13:45,080 --> 03:13:49,420
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Ma'am, for the domestic market, we don't have recorded violations.

3643
03:13:49,439 --> 03:13:58,220
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): But we do recognize in some of our export markets, our trading partners have raised that there are issues with respect to the...

3644
03:13:58,760 --> 03:14:01,579
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): halal certification, violations with respect to halal certification.

3645
03:14:04,840 --> 03:14:07,600
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Tumutulong na para ayusin iyon, tama?

3646
03:14:07,600 --> 03:14:08,319
DTI halal-program respondent Bianca (functional attribution): Yes, Ma'am.

3647
03:14:08,319 --> 03:14:12,300
Rep. Dadah Kiram Ismula: Okay. Madam Chair, maraming salamat, and maraming salamat po sa DTI.

3648
03:14:13,600 --> 03:14:18,100
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you, Representative Ismula. Next in line is Representative Tina Pancho.

3649
03:14:19,560 --> 03:14:20,899
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Good afternoon po, Ma'am.

3650
03:14:21,399 --> 03:14:25,520
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Ma'am, with regard to Francisco and Sarao Motors and Amante,

3651
03:14:26,640 --> 03:14:31,080
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: kaya sila nagsara because of the public utility modernization.

3652
03:14:31,080 --> 03:14:39,759
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: program during the time, kasi they're offering 1.3 million na mga jeep, mga modernized vehicle,

3653
03:14:40,080 --> 03:14:48,600
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: pero ang naging priority po ng government natin yung mga vehicles coming from China amounting to 2.3 million.

3654
03:14:49,399 --> 03:14:50,040
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So hindi sila

3655
03:14:50,040 --> 03:14:50,860
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: na-prioritize.

3656
03:14:51,040 --> 03:14:53,440
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So, they shifted to

3657
03:14:54,040 --> 03:14:55,799
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: EVs sa mga jeepney ngayon.

3658
03:14:56,359 --> 03:14:57,720
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: So, ano assurance natin

3659
03:14:57,720 --> 03:14:59,580
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: sa government na ipaprioritize

3660
03:14:59,800 --> 03:15:01,720
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: naman this time, yung ating

3661
03:15:01,720 --> 03:15:03,760
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: Sarao and Francisco Motors

3662
03:15:03,760 --> 03:15:04,759
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: na may

3663
03:15:06,040 --> 03:15:06,779
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: EV sila

3664
03:15:07,359 --> 03:15:08,580
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: at 985,000

3665
03:15:09,000 --> 03:15:09,600
Rep. Agustina Dominique "Ditse Tina" C. Pancho: only.

3666
03:15:11,520 --> 03:15:13,680
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Um, yes, Honorable

