DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: na ang DTI po, di naman kami

4040
03:28:06,800 --> 03:28:09,199
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: nagkukulang sa pag-push

4041
03:28:09,199 --> 03:28:11,040
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: ng higher budget and resources

4042
03:28:11,040 --> 03:28:13,040
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: for industrial development.

4043
03:28:13,040 --> 03:28:15,239
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: Kaya lang nga, yung overall fiscal,

4044
03:28:15,239 --> 03:28:16,880
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: it will have to compete

4045
03:28:16,880 --> 03:28:18,680
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: with the overall

4046
03:28:18,680 --> 03:28:21,439
DTI Undersecretary Ceferino S. Rodolfo: fiscal space sa gobyerno.

4047
03:28:21,439 --> 03:28:22,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Thank you, Madam Chair.

4048
03:28:22,920 --> 03:28:24,800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Just to wind up, Madam Chair,

4049
03:28:24,800 --> 03:28:26,399
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: gusto ko pong ipunto to,

4050
03:28:26,399 --> 03:28:30,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: dahil no other than the President,

4051
03:28:30,000 --> 03:28:31,040
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Bongbong Marcos

4052
03:28:31,040 --> 03:28:33,000
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Jr. himself, said,

4053
03:28:33,000 --> 03:28:35,399
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa natitirang dalawang taon

4054
03:28:35,399 --> 03:28:36,560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng kanyang termino,

4055
03:28:36,560 --> 03:28:39,479
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: we have to make use of that two years

4056
03:28:39,479 --> 03:28:41,160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: to make jobs,

4057
03:28:41,160 --> 03:28:43,279
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: better jobs, high-paying

4058
03:28:43,279 --> 03:28:44,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: jobs.

4059
03:28:44,920 --> 03:28:46,439
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: E, mananatili pong pangako

4060
03:28:46,439 --> 03:28:48,439
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: lang yun. Kung mismo

4061
03:28:48,439 --> 03:28:50,560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: mga kagawaran natin, mga department

4062
03:28:50,560 --> 03:28:52,800
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: natin, e, hindi tumutugon

4063
03:28:52,800 --> 03:28:55,399
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa sinabi mismo ng Pangulo.

4064
03:28:55,399 --> 03:28:56,560
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Madam Chair,

4065
03:28:56,560 --> 03:28:58,760
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: for the 2027 budget

4066
03:28:58,760 --> 03:29:00,359
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: of DTI, malinaw

4067
03:29:00,359 --> 03:29:02,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na malinaw po na nakasulat dito,

4068
03:29:02,640 --> 03:29:04,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: pababa ang budget

4069
03:29:04,120 --> 03:29:06,239
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sa industry development

4070
03:29:06,239 --> 03:29:08,399
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: program natin. Ang kahulugan

4071
03:29:08,399 --> 03:29:10,880
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: po niyan, hindi makakaasa

4072
03:29:10,880 --> 03:29:12,279
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang mga manggagawa,

4073
03:29:12,279 --> 03:29:14,680
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang mas magagandang trabaho.

4074
03:29:14,680 --> 03:29:16,279
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: Unless we address

4075
03:29:16,279 --> 03:29:18,720
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: this problem, Madam Chair,

4076
03:29:18,720 --> 03:29:20,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: e, dun lang po magkakatotoo yung

4077
03:29:20,120 --> 03:29:21,920
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sinasabi ng Pangulo at ng gobyerno

4078
03:29:21,920 --> 03:29:24,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: na magkakaroon ng dekalidad

4079
03:29:24,120 --> 03:29:26,319
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: at maayos na mga trabaho.

4080
03:29:26,319 --> 03:29:28,279
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At kung yan po ang patutunguhan

4081
03:29:28,279 --> 03:29:30,359
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ng DTI, kung nais

4082
03:29:30,359 --> 03:29:32,359
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: niyo po na ilaban at dagdagan

4083
03:29:32,359 --> 03:29:34,199
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: ang budget dito sa industry

4084
03:29:34,199 --> 03:29:36,120
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: development program,

4085
03:29:36,120 --> 03:29:38,279
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: makakaasa po kayo na ako pa ang numero

4086
03:29:38,279 --> 03:29:40,160
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: uno na makikipagdebate para

4087
03:29:40,160 --> 03:29:43,279
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: taasan yung budget sa industry development program.

4088
03:29:43,279 --> 03:29:44,840
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: But Madam Chair,

4089
03:29:44,840 --> 03:29:46,239
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: hearing from the DTI,

4090
03:29:46,239 --> 03:29:48,640
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: para pong nakukulangan tayo doon sa

4091
03:29:48,640 --> 03:29:49,080
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: sagot

4092
03:29:49,080 --> 03:30:04,199
Rep. Elijah Rumbaoa San Fernando: At sa enthusiasm na talagang magkaroon ng industry development program. So hindi po sapat na meron lang trabaho, kundi dapat sagutin natin ang tanong, anong klaseng trabaho ang nililikha natin. Yun lang po, Madam Chair. Maraming salamat.

4093
03:30:04,199 --> 03:30:10,820
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you, Representative San Fernando. Next in line, Representative Filimon Espares.

4094
03:30:12,199 --> 03:30:25,779
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Thank you, Madam Chair, and good afternoon to our colleagues and DTI family. Firstly, I would like to express my support to the budget of the DTI and whatever adjustment we could have.

4095
03:30:26,319 --> 03:30:39,260
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: But then, Madam Chair, I observed that the budget of the DTI right now reduces up to a billion, and why such budget has been cut that much.

4096
03:30:40,239 --> 03:30:57,599
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So we need to hear the explanation, of course, from the DTI. Bakit sobrang layo na ng budget natin compared to the GAA of 2026, Madam Chair? Anong nangyari?

4097
03:30:59,439 --> 03:31:09,960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Good afternoon, Honorable Congressman. Actually, we did not expect also na bumaba yung budget because we have a lot of programs,

4098
03:31:09,960 --> 03:31:27,160
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: and there's also a lot of things that we need to do to be able to contribute to providing jobs and also to provide the industries with a push para at least makausa din sila.

4099
03:31:27,160 --> 03:31:39,880
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So this is why we are here, to ask for additional budget for the three main mandates of DTI, which is investment promotion, consumer protection, and fair trade.

4100
03:31:39,880 --> 03:31:45,239
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And also the MSME development. So yun ang kailangan po natin.

4101
03:31:45,239 --> 03:31:53,359
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Because we need to, the only way for us to be able to push also these programs is for us to be able to have the budget that we need.

4102
03:31:53,359 --> 03:32:00,959
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Without this budget, then it will be difficult for us to also push the products that we need to export or that we need to sell locally.

4103
03:32:01,439 --> 03:32:11,000
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And then we also need to enforce and to make sure that the products that are being sold in the market pass through the standards of DTI.

4104
03:32:11,000 --> 03:32:19,960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: And we want to encourage more investors to come into the Philippines, but again, we also need budget to be able to promote this.

4105
03:32:19,960 --> 03:32:32,439
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Even if our numbers are up, our exports are up, also our investments are up, but then there's also the Middle East crisis that also contributed to the challenge that we are facing now.

4106
03:32:32,439 --> 03:32:37,580
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: But again, tuloy-tuloy pa rin ang mga programa ng DTI.

4107
03:32:41,080 --> 03:32:52,960
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: To level up also the skills of the people, that's why we work very closely with TESDA on industries that are relevant nowadays or industries of the investors that are coming in.

4108
03:32:52,960 --> 03:33:00,199
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi actually, nung kausap namin yung mga investors, ang hinihingi nila, talent, talent, talent.

4109
03:33:00,199 --> 03:33:05,600
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we need also the other departments to provide us with these talents.

4110
03:33:06,040 --> 03:33:10,160
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: So we have a program with ADB, which we are...

4111
03:33:10,160 --> 03:33:19,760
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We are hoping to conclude already, which is ASCEND, which will train our people for higher-paying jobs.

4112
03:33:19,760 --> 03:33:30,920
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Kasi now, we have jobs for people, but of course, the jobs are not high paying or jobs that we want them to achieve also, at least in the future.

4113
03:33:30,920 --> 03:33:32,880
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yes, Madam Chair. Thank you.

4114
03:33:33,199 --> 03:33:39,560
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: For the record, Madam Chair, can we consider the request of the agency for their

4115
03:33:39,560 --> 03:33:41,319
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: ...adjustments of the budget, no?

4116
03:33:41,319 --> 03:33:43,150
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: As mentioned.

4117
03:33:43,150 --> 03:33:44,199
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Because we need that, no?

4118
03:33:44,199 --> 03:33:47,819
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Especially on the development of people.

4119
03:33:48,439 --> 03:33:48,980
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yes, correct.

4120
03:33:49,840 --> 03:33:50,680
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Thank you with that.

4121
03:33:50,680 --> 03:33:53,280
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: And then, medyo limited ang oras.

4122
03:33:54,040 --> 03:33:56,719
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Gusto ko lang tingnan din ang budget, no, ng CDA.

4123
03:33:57,080 --> 03:33:58,220
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Because this is my sector.

4124
03:33:59,000 --> 03:34:05,059
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, nawala na rin ang almost 400 million on the part ng CDA.

4125
03:34:05,640 --> 03:34:09,120
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: At kahit yung capital outlay, nawala na rin.

4126
03:34:09,120 --> 03:34:09,920
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, ang tanong ko dito...

4127
03:34:09,920 --> 03:34:17,199
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: ...dito sa CDA, are you good for this reduction and even no budget for your capital outlay?

4128
03:34:17,199 --> 03:34:26,739
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Because in 2026, mayroon kayong capital outlay pa na requirement at the same time.

4129
03:34:27,399 --> 03:34:39,479
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Suppose, pataas ng pataas yung ating budget dahil mas malaki na yung task natin or the scope of the operations,

4130
03:34:39,479 --> 03:34:41,500
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: especially to support cooperative.

4131
03:34:41,600 --> 03:34:53,859
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, may I hear from the CDA if you are good with this budget, lower by almost ₱400 million compared with the 2026 GAA?

4132
03:34:55,120 --> 03:34:55,799
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Yeah, go ahead.

4133
03:34:57,560 --> 03:34:58,160
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Thank you.

4134
03:34:58,160 --> 03:35:00,720
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Thank you, Madam Secretary, Madam Chair.

4135
03:35:00,720 --> 03:35:03,720
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Yes, may you introduce yourself first?

4136
03:35:03,720 --> 03:35:06,399
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Yeah, my name is Alexander Raquepo.

4137
03:35:06,399 --> 03:35:09,340
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: I'm the chairperson of the Cooperative Development Authority.

4138
03:35:11,120 --> 03:35:18,400
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Yes, of course, we always wish for a bigger budget, Your Honor.

4139
03:35:19,279 --> 03:35:26,160
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: But when we submitted the original budget to DBM, it was slashed.

4140
03:35:26,160 --> 03:35:33,020
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: And we were told that there will be no construction budget for next year.

4141
03:35:33,880 --> 03:35:45,800
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: And we are going to complete the vehicle purchase that we have and the enhancement of our computer's hardware before the end of this year.

4142
03:35:45,800 --> 03:35:48,760
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: So, we have no budget on this.

4143
03:35:49,279 --> 03:35:55,479
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: And to answer your question, we will make do with whatever is approved, Your Honor.

4144
03:35:56,680 --> 03:36:01,539
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yeah, Madam Chair, if building ang pag-usapan, nag-ikot din ako.

4145
03:36:02,520 --> 03:36:07,799
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Parang anim na regional offices ng ating CDA ang walang permanent office.

4146
03:36:08,199 --> 03:36:09,479
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, nagre-rent lang sila.

4147
03:36:09,479 --> 03:36:11,600
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: But then, they have the property.

4148
03:36:12,120 --> 03:36:16,160
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: But they cannot have their own office in the region level.

4149
03:36:16,640 --> 03:36:21,100
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, imagine mo, nasa 40 to 50 personnel ang dapat ma-host.

4150
03:36:21,680 --> 03:36:26,600
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: And then, the government is still spending on the rentals of those.

4151
03:36:26,600 --> 03:36:31,080
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, mas maganda rin sana siguro na mag-support tayo.

4152
03:36:31,080 --> 03:36:35,220
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: And then, provide them a good office building.

4153
03:36:35,640 --> 03:36:37,180
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Para, ah...

4154
03:36:37,840 --> 03:36:44,560
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Maging conducive na rin yung pag-serve ng ating CDA to the cooperatives in different regions.

4155
03:36:44,560 --> 03:36:52,440
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, alam ko may apat hanggang anim pa yata na office na wala tayong, yeah, regional office na wala tayong building.

4156
03:36:53,640 --> 03:36:55,199
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: I think I'm correct on that.

4157
03:36:55,199 --> 03:36:56,320
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Anim, Your Honor.

4158
03:36:57,120 --> 03:36:58,760
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Anim pang regional offices.

4159
03:36:58,760 --> 03:37:01,880
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Yung dalawa is about to be completed.

4160
03:37:01,880 --> 03:37:06,640
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, can you submit that here in this committee para mapag-aralan namin?

4161
03:37:06,640 --> 03:37:07,960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Baka pwede natin makita.

4162
03:37:07,960 --> 03:37:08,600
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Yes, Your Honor.

4163
03:37:08,600 --> 03:37:10,080
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: We will submit that.

4164
03:37:10,080 --> 03:37:11,199
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: And thank you.

4165
03:37:11,199 --> 03:37:13,840
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Thank you for that opportunity and support.

4166
03:37:14,399 --> 03:37:15,000
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Okay.

4167
03:37:15,000 --> 03:37:23,439
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, another, Madam Chair, itong part din ng financial assistance, subsidy sa mga cooperatives dati, may 157 million.

4168
03:37:23,439 --> 03:37:25,120
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Ngayon, 5 million na lang din.

4169
03:37:25,120 --> 03:37:37,800
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, my question, how are you going to help cooperatives, especially those, yung mga distress, yung mga gusto mag-merge na gusto ninyo i-provide yung mga subsidies dito para ma-encourage sila.

4170
03:37:37,800 --> 03:37:40,000
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Mag-consolidate at mag-merge.

4171
03:37:40,000 --> 03:37:43,160
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, parang wala tayong budget na ngayon dito.

4172
03:37:43,720 --> 03:37:47,179
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: 120 dati sa 2025 million.

4173
03:37:47,199 --> 03:37:48,999
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: 120 million sa 2025.

4174
03:37:49,800 --> 03:37:51,179
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: 2026, 157.

4175
03:37:51,560 --> 03:37:53,800
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Now, here come 5 million na lang.

4176
03:37:53,800 --> 03:38:08,079
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, question there, how are you going to respond the requirements of the, especially small co-ops, distress, and those who wanted to enhance through merging and consolidation?

4177
03:38:09,760 --> 03:38:16,720
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: We will use the 5 million in promoting the program, Mr. Chair, Your Honor.

4178
03:38:16,720 --> 03:38:29,220
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: But we would earnestly request on the side probably 150 million for financial assistance to small co-ops and micro-cooperatives, sana.

4179
03:38:30,120 --> 03:38:30,439
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Okay.

4180
03:38:30,439 --> 03:38:37,520
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, again, Madam Chair, I would like to manifest that the request of the CDA as much as possible.

4181
03:38:37,520 --> 03:38:44,800
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Especially on the support to the different co-operatives all over the country will be provided with such fund.

4182
03:38:44,800 --> 03:38:47,420
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Maliit lang naman ito, ₱150 million.

4183
03:38:48,040 --> 03:38:59,079
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, again, with that, mayroon pa bang request or additional mga request ng ating CDA?

4184
03:39:00,040 --> 03:39:07,280
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: So far, wala na, Your Honor, except if ever the request for additional buildings for...

4185
03:39:07,720 --> 03:39:17,319
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: The other regions that we still don't have permanent offices, that will be a very welcome and thankful development, Your Honor.

4186
03:39:17,319 --> 03:39:17,640
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Okay.

4187
03:39:17,640 --> 03:39:19,540
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, last na lang ito, Madam Chair.

4188
03:39:19,760 --> 03:39:29,120
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: With regards on the staffing of our CDA, mayroon tayong 879 authorized position, but then 697 lang na-filled up.

4189
03:39:29,120 --> 03:39:36,079
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, may mga 182 pa tayo na hindi, ah, na-vacancy, no, sa ating offices.

4190
03:39:37,960 --> 03:39:38,640
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Um,

4191
03:39:38,640 --> 03:39:47,439
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: I know, I understand, and I gathered information na minsan sobrang delay ang processing natin ng ating mga nire-request ng co-ops,

4192
03:39:47,439 --> 03:39:55,180
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: especially yung mga pag-issue ng mga certificate of compliance.

4193
03:39:55,960 --> 03:40:04,560
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Yung iba sa amendments, umabot tayo ng mga tag isang taon bago ma-release yung mga amendments of articles of cooperation and bylaws.

4194
03:40:04,560 --> 03:40:07,140
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, ang sagot palagi sa ground is wala tayong

4195
03:40:07,920 --> 03:40:08,960
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: personnel, kulang.

4196
03:40:08,960 --> 03:40:15,620
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: So, why hindi natin kaya ito mapunuan dahil authorized naman itong 879?

4197
03:40:16,080 --> 03:40:17,800
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you, Representative Espares.

4198
03:40:17,800 --> 03:40:19,259
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: That would be your last question.

4199
03:40:19,359 --> 03:40:19,880
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Thank you.

4200
03:40:20,680 --> 03:40:21,559
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Can I hear the answer?

4201
03:40:22,720 --> 03:40:30,640
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: We have submitted the request for reorganization, Your Honor, to the DBM, and we are waiting for its approval.

4202
03:40:30,640 --> 03:40:37,439
CDA Chairperson Alexander B. Raquepo: Once it is approved, then we will proceed with the hiring needed for additional personnel.

4203
03:40:37,439 --> 03:40:41,720
Rep. Felimon M. Espares: Okay, so we need to have that action, Madam Chair, the soonest.

4204
03:40:41,720 --> 03:40:44,479
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: We will note that po, Cong. Espares.

4205
03:40:44,479 --> 03:40:50,790
Rep. Charisse Anne C. Hernandez: Next to ask is Representative Rufus Rodriguez.

4206
03:40:50,800 --> 03:40:55,794
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: Thank you very much madam chairman madam chairperson Hernandez

4207
03:40:56,872 --> 03:41:00,128
Rep. Rufus B. Rodriguez: President Gloria Makapagal Aroyo.

