6064
05:33:23,200 --> 05:33:42,080
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: We have different foreign trade attachés globally. So, nakakahanap po kami ng market para sa kanila and also locally. I'll forward you, Kong, Honorable Kong, to the trade negotiator, to our chief negotiator to discuss yung 12.5%.

6065
05:33:42,080 --> 05:33:44,360
DTI Secretary Maria Cristina Aldeguer-Roque: Usec. Allan?

6066
05:33:44,360 --> 05:33:51,520
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Ano ba na-explain nyo? Bakit, ano yung sabihin nito? Like, my understanding, mainly this is...

6067
